    "informal_stmt": "Prove that for non-negative real numbers $a, b, c$, the following inequality holds: $(a^{2}+b^{2}-c^{2})(a-b)^{2}+(b^{2}+c^{2}-a^{2})(b-c)^{2}+(c^{2}+a^{2}-b^{2})(c-a)^{2}\\geq 0$.",
