    "informal_stmt": "Let a,b,c are three sides of an triangle satisfied: a+b+c=3. Prove that:\\n $ \\frac {1}{\\sqrt [3]{a + b - c}} + \\frac {1}{\\sqrt [3]{a + c - b}} + \\frac {1}{\\sqrt [3]{b + c - a}}\\geq \\frac {9}{\\sqrt {ab + bc + ca}}$",
    "informal_proof": "",
    "url": "/home/deng254/CS59200_S26/ReProver/data/lean_workbook_reprover/project",
